  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></math> be a function defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></math>, then the least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to ______"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>·</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now, solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now, using the formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p>So, on comparing we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
}